          <div class="float-container">
            <div style="float:left;width:33.333333%;padding-right:20px;box-sizing:border-box;">
              <p style="text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;">(T. EARNINGS + OTHER INCOME) - T. DEDUCTON</p>
